  /* Never leave anyone behind (20 Sep 2026, Careers): a second figure beside the first (the same person as
     Learn · Teach · Reach). The friend drifts away to the right, the line between them draws out to
     reach them, and they are drawn back alongside. The friend is filled with the surface colour so the
     line disappears behind them as they return. Trim path + transform only, solid; rests at 0% and 100%. */
  .pictogram--value-behind {
    --pg-cycle: 3.2s;
